WEBVTT
NOTE Original proposed captions for an unrendered 42-second concept. NOT synced to filmed or recorded media.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
A weight moves. The hand holding it feels still.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:15.000
For more than a century, researchers have studied how expectation and movement can interact.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:23.000
One experiment found an intriguing result. Another did not reproduce it.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:31.000
That lesson matters when a recording promises to change your focus.

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:38.000
Ask what you receive, what you want, and what has actually been tested.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Read the evidence first.
